{
  "bookId": "rewind-4",
  "id": "chapter-12",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "901001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "网上那条留言显示的地址，就是这附近。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "想到很快就要见到真恋的主人，忍不住替她感到高兴呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "谢谢你们陪我来，真的非常感谢，我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "感谢的话就不用了啦，只要真恋能回到主人的身边、和主人幸福地生活在一起，优纪就会很开心很开心的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "有个地方我一直没有想明白，就是人类会随意把家里的地址写在网上么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "为什么不会？真恋的主人也很想找回真恋，所以才把地址发布到网上，不是理所当然的事情吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，我们到了，真恋主人现在居住的地方就在前面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "顽皮兔",
          "text": "呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "发生了什么事情，它慌慌张张地是要去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "请问……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "顽皮兔",
          "text": "闪开！！！别挡路！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "前面又有朝我们这边跑过来的，要不要问问看他们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "失礼了，请问这里发生了什么事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柠檬崽",
          "text": "饶命啊，饶命啊！！！不要问我！我什么都不知道！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "打扰一下，请问你们这是遇到什么事情了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "菠萝熊",
          "text": "快跑！快跑啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "菠萝熊",
          "text": "那家伙要追上来了！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“那家伙”是谁？这里究竟发生了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "菠萝熊",
          "text": "不知道我什么都不知道，不要问我了啊啊啊啊啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "总觉得有些奇怪呢，我们现在该怎么办啊，和江？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "901025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "事情看来有些棘手，我们继续朝真恋主人的家前进，一定要多加小心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-98",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
