      ],
      "title": "#2 未知的危险"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "903001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔，总算都藏好了，那家伙真的会出现吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "嘘，禁声，前面好像有动静。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶？这么快就出现了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "站住！不许跑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903005",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "杰斯 · 梅菲斯特之瞳\n商品名称：杰斯·梅菲斯特之瞳 Ver.\n作品名称：《终焉地平线》\n制造商：TENMA 天马\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型・附专用底座・全高约258mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "忧郁熊",
          "text": "我我我我我又不傻，为为为什么不跑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "混蛋！把我妹妹交出来！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "忧郁熊",
          "text": "你你你你在说什么？！我不认识你妹妹啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "我的耐心很有限，再说最后一次——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "把我的妹妹还给我！立刻！！马上！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "忧郁熊",
          "text": "我真的不知道你的妹妹啊啊啊，饶命啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "既然你不肯交出我的妹妹，那我就只好——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "惩、罚、你、了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "忧郁熊",
          "text": "你不要过来，求求你，不要过来啊！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "死吧——死吧——死吧！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "忧郁熊",
          "text": "哎——呦——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，他、他、他居然把那个可怜的手办给扔、出、去了……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "这个高度如果摔在地上的话，身上的零件肯定都会碎掉的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "从我们这个地方冲过去的话，说不定能接住它，我来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我想可能太迟了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "怎么会……我们只能眼睁睁看着它被摔成碎片了吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "903022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "咦，那是什么——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-100",
