        }
      ],
      "title": "#4 赤红之瞳"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "905001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "各位，就此告辞。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶，他们走的方向似乎跟我们是一样的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个，请等一下！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "怎么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们在找这样的一个地方，请问你知道怎么走吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "你们确认是这个地址没错么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "绝对不会有错的！这里就是我们的好朋友真恋的家，我们要送她回去跟自己的主人团聚！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "那就有点奇怪了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "哪里、哪里奇怪，是不是没有这个地址……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "不，恰恰相反，这个地址就是我主人的家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "真、真的吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "怎么会这么巧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这么说的话，大叔和真恋同属于一个主人，那么你们为什么会不认识呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "我记得从前的时候，主人是只有我一个手办的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你离家不在的这段时间，是不是错过了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "这并不奇怪，我来到主人家里的时间比较晚，也许你们可以找机会问问杰斯和他的妹妹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "他们两个是主人家里最早的一批手办，应该会了解不少主人和手办们的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "不过，我们得先帮杰斯找到他的妹妹，不然他是不会好好跟你交流的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "905020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "好、好的，我们走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-102",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
